WEBVTT

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:11.130
Black Doggy Dormitory
Black Doggy House

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:14.610
You White Cats make me sick.
You should stay in your dorm.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:14.620
Black Doggy Dormitory
Black Doggy House

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:15.170
White Cats Dormitory
White Cats House

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:18.000
Go back to the woods, Black Doggies.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.550
What was that?

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:20.850
Juliette Persia
White Cats House - 1st Year Leader

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.600
Today we settle things.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.500
Yes, ma'am!
Juliette Persia
White Cats House - 1st Year Leader

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:24.360
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.520
We'll show you the ferocity of the Black Doggies.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:30.260
Right, Inuzuka?

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:30.650
Romeo Inuzuka
Black Doggy House - 1st Year Leader

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.630
What's wrong? You're making a llama face!

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.570
Are you calling me a llama?

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.760
Oh, you're back!

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.680
It's time you were tamed, Black Doggies!

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.520
Let's go, everyone!

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:31.840
I was watching you with my hidden feelings from afar

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:40.690
As you lit up with a thousand lights, I felt the wind blowing at that moment

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:46.690
I expressed all of my feelings to you

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:52.030
I heard my heart beating, I can't look away

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:57.200
I decided to become strong enough to change the world

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:00.960
So that I can protect you

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:06.460
Beyond the dazzling times, we will have a miraculous encounter

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:12.010
Which will ensure that we get closer despite our limitless dreams

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:17.060
but know that we will courageously overcome this obstacle that faces us

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:24.020
Don't forget that we are united by a force of determination that no one knows.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.920
Rosario and Juliet

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:31.600
Take that!

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:35.630
Inuzuka, if you need Hasuki's help, I'll back you up!

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:38.340
Lady Persia, I've come to help you.

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:43.350
-Where'd she go?
-Hold on.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.600
Where are we going? What if someone sees us?

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.580
Come on, what's the big deal?

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:52.040
Deal? There isn't one, really.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.790
It's just...

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:58.490
I wanted to know more about you.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:02.870
My blood type is A. My birthday is July 1st.
My vision is 1.0--

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.240
That's not what I meant!

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:08.640
I guess I just wanted to be alone with you.

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:11.250
If you've got no business with me, I'm heading back.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.500
How cold...

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:15.480
Doesn't being a couple mean...

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.520
-Juli!
-Romio!

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:20.400
...being more lovey-dovey and stuff?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.180
Wait!

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:26.070
Even if there's no reason, or if it's dangerous,

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:27.560
I want to be with you!

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:32.560
That's how much... I...

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:35.420
L-- Lo--

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:37.940
-Lo--
-Found you, Inuzuka!

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.450
Iron claw!

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.210
Did you need something?

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:43.820
I wanted to back you up!

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:45.830
No thanks! I can handle this on my own.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.510
Don't worry about it!

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:48.800
I'm not worried, I--

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:50.580
I said...

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:53.830
that hurts! Idiot!

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.460
Inuzuka!

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:02.970
Persia...

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.600
Inuzuka's been beaten!

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:16.420
Persia, is it true you defeated Inuzuka?

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:18.230
Yeah.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:21.300
Amazing! I wish I could be like you.

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.760
Well, I'll be heading out first.

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:28.970
Good job today.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:40.440
Father!

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:43.010
Some beautiful flowers bloomed in the garden!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:50.450
I'm very busy. Don't interrupt me without due cause.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:03.540
Even if there's no reason, or if it's dangerous,

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.570
I want to be with you!

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:10.330
Persia! Persia! Persia!

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:13.720
Over here!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.250
Here!

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.970
How come you're out there?

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:19.140
I climbed up.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:21.000
I wasn't asking how you did it!

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.270
I can't believe you! You pervert! You peeping tom!

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:27.570
Wait, wait! I didn't mean that. I'm sorry.

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:30.450
This time I do have something to say.

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:34.770
What is it?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.770
I just wanted to apologize for earlier.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.270
I've done a lot of research,

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:44.040
into how I could help you, as a lover.

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:48.460
What do Westerners do as lovers?

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:51.010
What about gifting a rosary?

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:55.790
Yeah! Giving them your rosary
is proof of being lovers.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.680
That's it.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:59.420
Who are you, mister?

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:03.800
It might just be self-satisfaction,

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:07.530
but I want you to accept this as proof of our love.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:11.360
This...

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:12.930
Inuzuka!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.930
What are you doing over there?

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:18.690
I could ask you the same thing.

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.940
-As you can see, I'm on guard duty!
-Liar!

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.540
Well, what about you?

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:26.420
I'm sure you intend to attack Persia
while her guard is down! You bastard!

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:28.200
That's right!

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:31.370
-I won't allow it!
-Idiot, let go!

00:06:46.980 --> 00:06:48.720
You're awake?

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:52.480
The dorm? How did I get here?

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:54.850
They said you were thrown off a roof by Persia.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.100
That girl is like the devil.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:58.780
No, it was...

00:06:58.780 --> 00:06:59.990
But it's okay!

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:03.480
Everyone said they'd get revenge on Persia
and went after her.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.210
Inuzuka is one thing,

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.610
but we have to protect the Black Doggies' good name!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:08.610
Seriously?

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:11.410
Hey! You have to stay calm now!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.460
If you stay put,

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:18.470
Hasuki would gladly
nurse you back to health every day.

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:21.350
Okay, Inuzuka--?

00:07:21.350 --> 00:07:21.420
Yotaro?

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:22.500
Dorm Dog
Dorm Dog
Yotaro?

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.260
Good, she's okay. Persia!

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:35.140
Inuzuka?

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:39.360
Hey, why are you running? Stop!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.520
I can't!

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.830
What? Why...?

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:48.030
-Get her!
-You won't get away with this!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.670
Guys, stop!

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:51.530
I'll settle things with Persia!

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.740
What is it this time?

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.260
You scumbags.

00:07:56.260 --> 00:07:58.800
Coming after Persia as a mob.

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.250
What's the meaning of this?

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.550
Perfect timing, White Cat.

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:05.630
Shall we settle things here, Black Dog?

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:10.630
How did trying to give her one present lead to this?

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:15.010
Is that kind of thing just impossible at a school like this?

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:19.560
You have to show me that you can change the world.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:22.700
No. I can't give up so easily.

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:25.270
I'll give this to her no matter wh--

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:29.280
Think you have the luxury of spacing out, dumb dog?

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.690
You assholes...

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.280
Who do you think you're--?

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:51.190
Hey. Where are you going?

00:08:55.820 --> 00:08:58.150
How dare you...

00:08:58.150 --> 00:08:59.310
Hey!

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:00.900
The statue...

00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:05.310
I spent all of my pocket money buying that.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:09.190
How could you?

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.190
Idiot, you'll hit us too--

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:16.380
What?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.470
It's over, it's over.

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:22.970
It's all over!

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:43.200
I can't take this!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.850
I might as well just...

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.250
Hey!

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:59.950
You shouldn't dispose things in a lake.

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:04.180
I heard you're picking grass on the shore
as a punishment for breaking the statue.

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:05.680
Sorry.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.960
I ruined the gift I wanted to give you.

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:21.910
Hey, row the boat for me.

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.360
What if we're seen?

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.200
It's dark, so we're fine.

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:31.230
And you're the one who said
we can't be seen at all costs.

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:35.240
The wind feels nice tonight.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:41.800
But just being alone with Persia on a boat is...

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:45.180
Hold still for a second.

00:10:45.180 --> 00:10:46.370
But--

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:51.380
Was this what you wanted to give me?

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.730
Next time I go to town
I'll buy a better one.

00:10:54.730 --> 00:10:57.510
I won't mind if you just threw that piece of junk away.

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.770
Inuzuka.

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:07.700
Close your eyes.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:08.890
Hurry.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.440
Hey!

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.320
-You can't open them yet.
-So close!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.070
Come on, why did you open them?

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:28.760
How did you fix it? Alchemy?

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:30.210
It's mine.

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:33.100
I see.

00:11:33.100 --> 00:11:34.710
You already had one?

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.180
Of course.

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:40.400
Westerners use rosaries every morning for worship.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.650
I'm such a clown.

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:44.470
That's not true.

00:11:44.990 --> 00:11:48.360
In the West, you use a rosary for daily prayer,

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:51.730
or give them to someone special as a good luck charm.

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:56.910
That rosary was from my mother
as congratulations for getting accepted here.

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:59.420
I've prayed with it every day.

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:02.990
It's my most precious possession.

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:08.180
That's a token of my honest feelings.

00:12:08.180 --> 00:12:10.620
Take care of it, okay?

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:15.720
Besides, the important thing
about a rosary isn't its shape--

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:17.250
No way.

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:22.380
Something so precious
should be used for your own benefit.

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:26.010
For me, the thought is enough.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.280
I'm going home.

00:12:28.280 --> 00:12:29.560
What? Hold on.

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:39.960
Help me! Persia!

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:43.260
Why don't you take this time to cool your head.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.700
Why are you angry? Wait!

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.300
I can't swim!

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:51.180
Trying to act all cool. You're so dense.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.960
It has meaning because it's precious, idiot.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:59.850
Help! Lady Persia!

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:12.070
I'm looking forward to today's outing.

00:13:12.070 --> 00:13:14.350
Where should we go?

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:19.110
Inuzuka, let's hit the town together!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.290
Hasuki.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.330
Let's go to Dahlia Park!

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:25.110
Sorry. I've already got plans.

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.090
Plans? With who?

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:29.120
Inuzuka...

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:31.430
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:36.000
Who is this little cutie?

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:39.590
-It's fine. Shall we?
-Yeah.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.730
Anyway, I'm hanging out with him.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.380
Sorry again, Hasuki.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:48.440
It's like he's just not swayed by Hasuki.

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:52.280
Could it be Inuzuka swings that way?

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:54.890
Hasuki's on the ground over there.

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:57.410
Let's take her to the infirmary.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:00.650
Wow, you really fooled her.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:03.920
But now she has a different misunderstanding.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.150
A date?

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:08.920
Tomorrow is the one day in March
we get to go off campus.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:10.300
We don't have many chances--

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:12.120
-Impossible.
-That was fast!

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.300
Listen to me.

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:17.470
We have to hide in a confessional
just to talk to each other.

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:19.000
So, of course it's impossible.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:25.130
A disguise from Touwa!

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:30.010
With this we can go on a real date.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:33.030
It's my hand-me-down,

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:36.520
but I think it'll be harder to notice that way.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:39.700
Say something!

00:14:39.700 --> 00:14:40.870
Art thou a fool?

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:43.650
-Don't be so formal.
-If anyone finds out, it'll all be over.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.830
I don't want that at all.

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:52.410
But at this rate we'll never get to go on a date.

00:14:53.170 --> 00:14:57.620
You don't need to get that depressed.

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:00.170
I'm not depressed.

00:15:02.850 --> 00:15:06.390
Crying won't help get your way.
What's impossible is impossible.

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.300
Or so she said...

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:11.230
But she actually went along with it.

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:14.240
Is this really going to fool people?

00:15:14.240 --> 00:15:15.930
Lady Persia.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:17.930
Lady Persia!

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.440
We've been found out!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:22.790
That's odd...

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.410
I could have sworn I smelled Lady Persia.

00:15:25.410 --> 00:15:28.950
But all I'm seeing are two idiot Black Dogs.

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.170
Lady Persia, where are you?

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:34.450
Let's see the town together!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.090
That was close.

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:38.080
Do I smell?

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:43.730
All right. Now I can put the date plan
I made for today to use!

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:44.960
Inuzuka!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:46.270
Who's that?

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:48.340
Why are you angry?

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:52.530
He's a relative of mine. He's in middle school.

00:15:53.150 --> 00:15:54.650
His name's Julio.

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.240
What a weird name.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.600
I feel like I've seen him somewhere.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.820
Please...

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:03.860
don't stare at me so much, I'll be exposed.

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:06.330
I've got this weird feeling...

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.290
Dumbass, he's a guy!

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:11.700
That's true. And yet... And yet!

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:14.620
My heart's beating uncontrollably!

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.050
Who's this boy?

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:18.220
He's so cute!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:20.500
Come hang out with us girls!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.100
No, come with us guys!

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:23.680
We're your bros!

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.810
My date plan...

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.440
This town and the Dahlia Academy

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:37.640
were both made for the friendship
between Touwa and the West.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:40.770
It's strained right now, but someday--

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:42.200
Quit following us!

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:44.080
You can't hog him.

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.400
We want to hang out with Julio too!

00:16:47.910 --> 00:16:49.530
Then you'll have to defeat me.

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:51.280
Sounds good to me!

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:54.750
Doesn't Inuzuka seem excited today?

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:57.010
It may be the first time I've seen him this way.

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:58.660
Is this not normal?

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:01.590
He's never excited.

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:05.010
He always looks grumpy
and he doesn't join in conversations.

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:07.790
He gives off a "stay away" aura.

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:17.300
I wonder which would look best on Persia.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:18.530
Damn it.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:21.930
I can't buy a rosary in front of them!

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:28.940
The whole place is reserved?

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.460
Don't give me that crap!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:34.130
My plan to eat at a restaurant with a view of the ocean!

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.710
It's all reserved.

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:36.910
Oh, well.

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:39.700
Will you guys ever stop following us?

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.340
Let's go get ramen.

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:43.760
-Come with us, Julio.
-Okay.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.930
Hey, don't just decide things!

00:17:46.930 --> 00:17:49.100
Such a ruckus.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:52.960
This is why I can't stand those Black Dog savages.

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:55.720
That boy...

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.470
Ramen

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:01.220
Damn it. How did we end up
in this boring run of the mill shop?

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.070
-It's spicy.
-How cute.

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:06.310
Whoa, look how Julio's holding the chopsticks!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:10.570
If we don't cool you off you'll get burned!

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:14.070
Let go!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:15.920
Where should we go next?

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:18.070
Where do you want to go, Julio?

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.920
Our one-on-one lunch and shopping,

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:24.090
all ruined because of these guys.

00:18:24.090 --> 00:18:27.960
It's almost time to go home, what should I do?

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:32.390
Julio, let's go to the haunted house!

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:34.210
Haunted?

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.690
Come on, hurry up.

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.310
Wait!

00:18:37.310 --> 00:18:39.470
We can be alone together in the dark.

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.430
Persia?

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:44.860
Can't you see we're busy?

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.100
Don't get in the way!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:48.980
Zombie!

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.410
I've had enough!

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:54.210
Why is she mad?

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.360
Julio!

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:00.040
If you're looking for Julio, he just ran--

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.740
Hey, Inuzuka?

00:19:02.300 --> 00:19:04.740
Julio!

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:07.100
Where did she...?

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:11.010
-It can't be.
-This date was the worst.

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:14.380
She got tired of putting up with it and went home?

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:18.260
No way.

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:20.130
Yeah, a full day out!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:22.030
We did some serious shopping.

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:23.740
I'm beat!

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:27.030
Won't you wear some too, Maru? We'll all match.

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.780
I wouldn't be caught dead.

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:31.150
More importantly, look over there.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:33.650
-Inuzuka?
-What's he doing?

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:37.360
I'm going to pay him back for before.

00:19:38.420 --> 00:19:40.360
Inuzuka!

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:51.210
Wait a minute. Does he not know how to swim?

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:55.060
What's wrong? Can't swim?

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:58.350
If you don't swim, you'll drown.

00:19:58.350 --> 00:19:59.520
How lame.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:02.140
Could you move that foot of yours?

00:20:02.860 --> 00:20:04.570
He may be stupid,

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:06.760
but he's important to me.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:09.890
I've never seen this brat before.

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.140
Persia!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.580
Oh, no.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:15.160
We were just messing around with Inuzuka.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.150
I hope we can get along as well.

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.480
As if!

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:22.450
I'm no brat.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.240
A girl?

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.200
What...?

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:32.460
You shouldn't knock people into the sea.

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:35.960
Okay.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:39.960
Thanks for saving me.

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:44.190
You disappeared so suddenly,
I thought for sure you'd gone home.

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:48.030
The wig was starting to make my head itch.

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:50.770
I just went to the restroom to take it off.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.620
You weren't mad?

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:54.150
Why would I be mad?

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:57.900
Well, the date didn't go so well...

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:03.630
I hear you're normally rather gloomy.

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:06.410
That's completely different from when you're with me.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.130
And that "ramen" stuff
was way too spicy.

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:12.800
I can't believe you Touwa folk
eat it like it's nothing.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.420
What's this all of a sudden?

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:17.040
I'm discussing our date, of course.

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:22.580
Hey, what's your definition of a date?

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:23.900
Definition?

00:21:23.900 --> 00:21:26.690
Eating? Shopping?

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:30.810
I like to think it's about learning more about each other.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:35.990
So, today's date was a big success.

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:39.820
I mean, I got to see a face of yours I didn't know.

00:21:41.580 --> 00:21:43.710
Persia...

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:49.330
Let's go on another date soon.

00:21:50.210 --> 00:21:52.370
Persia!

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:53.580
Lady Persia!

00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:57.310
-Inuzuka!
-Battle continues!

00:21:57.310 --> 00:21:58.460
You knave!

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:01.480
Persia has come to fight Inuzuka in secret!

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:03.270
You dumb dog!

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:05.970
Why does it always end up like this?

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:32.680
Just running and running, so awkward and clumsy

00:22:32.850 --> 00:22:40.690
My passion is so intense that my heart yearns

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:47.990
Your eyes so honest and earnest

00:22:48.150 --> 00:22:54.620
I want to match the love you have for me

00:22:55.790 --> 00:23:02.840
You don't wait for your dreams to come true, you sprint onward

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:09.180
Pulling me by the hand when I had given up

00:23:09.340 --> 00:23:16.430
Your dream suddenly became my dream

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:18.640
I want to support you

00:23:18.810 --> 00:23:26.480
With everything I have

00:23:26.650 --> 00:23:34.580
Until the world can one day change

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:38.240
Persia...

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:39.730
About our next date--

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:40.910
I don't care.

00:23:40.910 --> 00:23:42.980
Don't say that!

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:48.460
So that's how it is.

00:23:53.000 --> 00:23:55.700
Disguising as Julio was nerve racking,

00:23:55.700 --> 00:23:58.300
but our date was surprisingly fun.

00:23:58.300 --> 00:24:01.550
Learning how Inuzuka cannot swim and
he's unusually romantic.

00:24:01.550 --> 00:24:03.840
I'm glad I've got to know him better.

00:24:03.840 --> 00:24:03.880
Next time, Romio and Princess Char.

00:24:03.880 --> 00:24:06.960
Romio and Princess Char
Next time, Romio and Princess Char.
